    "ext_prt_13_vmmu_page_r25",
    "ext_prt_14_vmmu_page_r26",
    "ext_prt_15_vmmu_page_r28"
   ],
   "remediation_implemented": "Slot-level alignment with `tesseract-vie` + grammar-derived Vietnamese lexicon (`ocr_lexicon.py`: 533 unigrams, 2,662 bigrams) restoring Vietnamese diacritics when consonant skeletons match (`CER` median `0.0705 -> 0.0149`)."
