    "ext_prt_13_vmmu_page_r25",
    "ext_prt_14_vmmu_page_r26"
   ],
   "remediation_implemented": "2D vertical-stack fraction detector (`FRACTION_STRUCTURE_SUSPECTED` / `SUBLINE_OVERLAP_SUSPECTED`) and `choice_bands` row grouping in `ocr_reconcile.py` (`Layout-Aware Reconciler`)."
  },
  "RC4_EMBEDDED_3D_DIAGRAM_LABEL_BLEED_AND_DEPENDENCY": {
