   ],
   "remediation_implemented": "Region-aware `figure_bboxes` separation in `ocr_reconcile.py`: figure tokens are routed to `diagram.tokens` (never concatenated into prose sentences) and classified into 5 explicit diagram states (`NO_DIAGRAM`, `DIAGRAM_LABELS_ONLY_CONSISTENT`, `DIAGRAM_LABELS_UNMATCHED`, `DIAGRAM_HAS_MEASUREMENTS`, `DIAGRAM_REFERENCED_BY_TEXT`, `DIAGRAM_PRESENT_UNREAD`)."
